    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "The founding fathers didn't decide an easy process. It's a messy process, very inefficient, very ineffective. And I knew that going in. And so what you're seeing now play out on C-SPAN and on social media. This has been going on for years, maybe not quite at this level. But it's been going on like this all along. I mean, the house is a melting pot of people from all over the country who come in with all sorts of ideas. and different groups of people to represent.",
